; --exchange with a source:target entry whose source the commodity pool
; does not know converts nothing: NONEXIST names no commodity, so the
; entry can match no amount and every amount prints unconverted.  An
; unknown source used to lift the entry's restriction and convert every
; commodity.

2024/01/01 Test
    Expenses:Food    100 EUR
    Assets:Cash      -$120.00

P 2024/01/01 EUR $1.20

test bal --exchange NONEXIST:$
            $-120.00  Assets:Cash
             100 EUR  Expenses:Food
--------------------
            $-120.00
             100 EUR
end test
